      "title": "ELGIEQUIP: New Arabia Arm And Onsite Nitrogen Savings Will Support Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the fair value estimate for Elgi Equipments steady at ₹645.00, with minor adjustments to the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin assumptions and future P/E feeding into a refreshed narrative rather than a change in the headline price target. What's in the News Giles Foodservice Equipment is generating nitrogen on-site using a system powered by an ELGi EG75 VFD rotary screw air compressor, designed with Mobile Mechanical Services to support continuous-duty manufacturing and potential future growth.",
